Imagery
- All pictures are SVG drawn by code in main.js / main_b.js / main_v1.js (+ frame_head.html filters and helpers). No photos, no AI-generated images, no sprites.
- All characters are original "bean" mascots. The AI products they stand for (GPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama, DeepSeek, 文心一言, 通义千问, Mistral, Kimi, Grok, BERT, DALL·E, Midjourney, Stable Diffusion, Sora, o1, Codex, Gemini CLI, Claude Code …) appear by NAME only, on name tags. No official logos, marks or product UI are used; colours are loose nods, not brand assets.
- Real people referenced by first name only in the 2011 quiz scene (KEN / BRAD podiums) and by name in history banners (Kasparov, Lee Sedol). Historical facts only, cartoon stand-ins, no likenesses. The quiz machine is a generic screen-faced bot, not IBM's Watson avatar.
- Genre reference (grammar only): rhythm-action party games (call-and-response cues, "Perfect!" judgements, stage cards). No names, characters, UI, levels or music from any real game were copied, and no game is named on screen.

